    "Delete this session snapshot? The note folder is not changed, but this session can no longer be reviewed or rolled back." : {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Delete this session snapshot? The note folder is not changed, but this session can no longer be reviewed or rolled back."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "删除此会话快照？笔记库不会被改动，但此会话将无法再审阅或回滚。"}}}},
